commit 35bdc2d28bf4d581ecf4ea91e486a9bb9b9aaca2
Author: konard <drakonard@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 15 09:57:13 2026 +0000

    fix: link repair and merge guard respect kept-open and other-repository sub-issues (#3174, #3276)
    
    - Repair no longer adds Fixes for non-primary sub-issues the description keeps
      open ("Part of #N", "#N stays open", ranges), nor for their subtrees.
    - Repair drops its own earlier Fixes lines that now conflict with the
      description instead of overriding the agent.
    - Sub-issues in other repositories are never required or repaired (#3276);
      the merge guard refuses PRs that would close them.
    - The merge guard refuses PRs whose GitHub closing references include an
      issue the description keeps open (negated keywords, old repair lines).

